# NestJS Backend Rules

## Stack

| Concern | Tool |
|---------|------|
| Framework | NestJS |
| Language | TypeScript (strict, no `any`) |
| Validation | class-validator + class-transformer |
| Config | @nestjs/config + Zod for env validation |
| Testing | Jest + Supertest |

## Layered architecture

```
Controller → Service → Repository
```

- **Controller**: route, auth guards, DTO binding, response shaping — no business logic
- **Service**: business rules, orchestration, error throwing — no DB queries
- **Repository**: data access only — no business decisions
- **Core**: global pipes, filters, guards, interceptors
- **Shared**: utilities and services reused across domain modules

