## Always avoid

- Business logic in controllers
- Direct DB access in controllers
- `any` type
- Validation logic inside service methods — use DTOs + pipes
- Returning raw entities from controllers (leaks internal fields)
- God services — split by entity/responsibility
- Circular module imports
- `new SomeService()` — always inject via constructor
